<title>SINGAPORE: Schering-Plough to open S$300 million plant.</title>
<headline>Schering-Plough to open S$300 million plant.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical company Schering-Plough Corp is set to open a Singapore $300 million bulk pharmaceutical chemical facility in Singapore next month, a statement said.</p>
<p>The statement, issued on behalf of the company on Tuesday, said the 100,000-square-metre plant would be officially opened in May.</p>
<p>Schering-Plough is headquartered in New Jersey.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
